{"about_the_game":"This is a simple game in which the objective is to artfully stack seven different types of blocks that fall according to gravity.<br />\r\nDuring the game, a countdown is given, and each time the count reaches zero, a block falls one by one.<br />\r\nYou can move the blocks to the left or right, or rotate them.<br />\r\nHowever, once the blocks start falling, you will not be able to manipulate them.<br />\r\nThe game is successful when all the blocks are piled up on the floor.<br />\r\nIf even one block falls down from the floor, it is a failure.<br />\r\nIt is more artistic to stack the blocks diagonally.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nReflexes are not required for this game.<br />\r\nInstead, it requires calm judgment and good sense.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1779500?t=1634626909","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1779500?t=1634626909","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1779500/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1634626909","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1779500/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1634626909","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"This is a simple game in which the objective is to artfully stack seven different types of blocks that fall according to gravity.<br />\r\nDuring the game, a countdown is given, and each time the count reaches zero, a block falls one by one.<br />\r\nYou can move the blocks to the left or right, or rotate them.<br />\r\nHowever, once the blocks start falling, you will not be able to manipulate them.<br />\r\nThe game is successful when all the blocks are piled up on the floor.<br />\r\nIf even one block falls down from the floor, it is a failure.<br />\r\nIt is more artistic to stack the blocks diagonally.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nReflexes are not required for this game.<br />\r\nInstead, it requires calm judgment and good sense.","developers":["Worker-TK"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1779500/header.jpg?t=1634626909","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":256854245,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256854245/movie480.mp4?t=1633438978","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256854245/movie_max.mp4?t=1633438978"},"name":"AllBlocksWantToBeStacked","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256854245/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1633438978","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256854245/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1633438978","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256854245/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1633438978"}}],"name":"AllBlocksWantToBeStacked","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"AllBlocksWantToBeStacked - $0.99 USD","packageid":638794,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":99}],"title":"Buy AllBlocksWantToBeStacked"}],"packages":[638794],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> VRAM 2GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":tru